### Get all users (first page, 20 items, sorted by lastName asc)
GET http://localhost:8080/users

### Get users page 3, size 10, sorted by dateOfBirth desc
GET http://localhost:8080/users?page=3&size=10&sort=dateOfBirth,desc

### Filter by lastName (partial, case-insensitive)
GET http://localhost:8080/users?lastName=ring

### Filter by exact dateOfBirth
GET http://localhost:8080/users?dateOfBirth=1978-07-22

### Combined filter + sort + paging
GET http://localhost:8080/users?page=0&size=5&sort=lastName,desc&lastName=a&dateOfBirth=1990-05-15

### Invalid sort property -> 400
GET http://localhost:8080/users?sort=firstName,asc

### Invalid sort direction -> 400
GET http://localhost:8080/users?sort=lastName,sideways

### Get user by id
GET http://localhost:8080/users/1

### Create user
POST http://localhost:8080/users
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "firstName": "John",
  "lastName": "Doe",
  "emailAdress": "john.doe@example.com",
  "dateOfBirth": "1990-05-15"
}

### Update user
PUT http://localhost:8080/users/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "firstName": "Jane",
  "lastName": "Doe",
  "emailAdress": "jane.doe@example.com",
  "dateOfBirth": "1992-08-21"
}

### Delete user
DELETE http://localhost:8080/users/1